/*
 * sync-to generator - core.entity_view_display.bb_project.bb_project.full
 *
 * The project Overview (BAKERS-55): one `canvas`. `main` holds the
 * `bb_project_overview` sections metrics, attention and epics, then the
 * `bb_entity_detail_activities` feed, then the page empty state (the three
 * ticket sections and the empty state exclude each other). `inspector` is one
 * surface `inspector` with two zones: About (the description) and
 * Properties (the `properties` entity form, with the Edit action for
 * holders of `update` access).
 *
 * THE SHIPPED YAML IS THE SAVED FORM (see README.md): `content` and `hidden`
 * are materialised from the entity's fields on first save and re-exported
 * from the site, not taken from this generator's empty maps.
 */
